OL,3,GNEWSAAssembly members clash at Stormont
OL,4,Aover Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssembly members have clashed in
OL,7,FStormont over the Drumcree parade
OL,8,Fdispute.
OL,10,FThe Parades Commission had banned this
OL,11,Fyear's Portadown parade from entering
OL,12,Fthe mainly nationalist Garvaghy Road -
OL,13,Fa move which reflected every decision
OL,14,Fit has made since 1998.
OL,16,FWhile a member of the commission later
OL,17,Fresigned over the matter, unionist
OL,18,Fparties have said that did not go far
OL,19,Fenough and that they had lost
OL,20,Fconfidence in the commission.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
